<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/><title>Search country flight, airport and airline help records | ThaiLiveNow</title><meta name="description" content="Search the airlines in our Thailand travel records by English name or flight code. Search all country flight, airport-counter, contact and help records, with English explanations and links to the full source-language guides."/></head><body><DetailHeader locale="en"/><main class="thai-detail"><h1>Search flight, airport and airline help across countries</h1><p>Choose a country or search all our country datasets below. Use the airline actually operating your flight when asking for help. Start with the airport team if your checked bag is missing or damaged, and keep your booking, baggage tag, report number and correspondence. This English directory is shared across markets; the conditions for your flight depend on its departure country, operating airline and ticket.</p><p><a href="/en/airport-assistance/airports/">Thailand airport arrival, departure and facility guides →</a></p><AirportGlobalSearch/><AirportAirlineFinder english/><section><h2>Flying from the United States?</h2><p>For US–Thailand routing and departure-airport check-in locations, use the United States guide. This shared directory is for airline support across markets.</p><p><a href="/en-us/airport-assistance/">United States–Thailand flights and airport check-in →</a></p></section><section><h2>Keep three requests separate</h2><p>Changing or refunding an airline ticket, reporting baggage and claiming on travel insurance are separate processes. A boarding confirmation and a delay or cancellation document can also serve different purposes. Ask the recipient which document it needs before submitting a claim.</p><p>This directory uses the airline records already collected for Thailand travel. It does not claim to cover every airline worldwide. The official links may open in the language of the airline’s source page.</p></section><p><a href="/ko/airport-assistance/" lang="ko">한국어 지연·결항·수하물 안내 →</a></p></main><SiteFooter locale="en"/></body></html>
